+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision, made on 2026-09-25, is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen because it is memory-hard, which defends against GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks, and because its design resists side-channel attacks. No later decision changing or revoking this choice is recorded.
